    subgraph UNOQ[Arduino UNO Q]
        MPU[QRB2210 MPU\nDebian Linux\n1.8 V I/O 域]
        BRIDGE[Arduino Bridge / RPC]
        MCU[STM32U585 MCU\nZephyr + Arduino Sketch\n3.3 V I/O 域]
        WIRELESS[无线模块 WCBN3536A\nWi-Fi 5 / Bluetooth 5.1]
